              "id": "sao-gallery-header",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 80px 56px;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"width:36px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(to right,#d4a853,transparent);\"></div>\n    <span style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4a853;\">Shamanic Retreats</span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px);letter-spacing:-1px;color:#0d1117;line-height:1.1;\">Join our<br><em style=\"color:rgba(13,17,23,0.3)\">shamanic family.</em></h2>\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.55);margin:20px 0 0;max-width:520px;\">Moments from retreats, ceremonies, and healing gatherings around the world. Replace images from the Media Library in Elementor editor.</p>\n</div>",
                "text_color": "",
                "typography_typography": "custom"
              }
            },
            {
